Description: Thick Generations-only shared LVM storage for Proxmox VE
 Experimental disposable-lab shared block backend restricted to fully
 allocated Thick Generations with a linear steady-state frontend.
 Thin allocation, Thin recovery commands and Thin runtime services are not
 available in this package flavor.
